1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:14,281
Všech pět karet z lekcí šest až deset – celé dialogy se zkoušejícím. A navíc dvanáct otázek, které se hodí skoro na každou kartu, a pět chyb, kvůli kterým lidé ztrácejí body. Připravte se a ptejte se nahlas!

2
00:00:15,167 --> 00:00:29,657
How does task 2 work? You get two cards with a situation. On each card you ask four questions: three from the hints and one of your own. The examiner answers. You can get twelve points in total.

3
00:00:30,567 --> 00:00:43,522
The card has only short hints. You must turn them into a full polite question. Now we go through all five cards. First ask yourself, then you hear a model question and the examiner’s answer.

4
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:47,588
Karta šest: Voláte do restaurace.

5
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:51,980
You are calling a restaurant. You want to book a table for Saturday.

6
00:00:53,167 --> 00:00:55,032
U Lva restaurant, good afternoon.

7
00:01:01,233 --> 00:01:04,164
Hello, do you have a free table for six on Saturday?

8
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:06,729
Yes, we have a free table on Saturday.

9
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:14,733
What time do you close?

10
00:01:14,933 --> 00:01:17,361
We're open until 11 pm.

11
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:25,231
Do you have vegetarian dishes?

12
00:01:25,433 --> 00:01:28,133
Yes, we have several vegetarian dishes.

13
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:36,056
Can we park at the restaurant?

14
00:01:36,267 --> 00:01:38,767
Yes, the car park is right behind the restaurant.

15
00:01:38,967 --> 00:01:41,967
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

16
00:01:42,167 --> 00:01:43,367
We look forward to seeing you.

17
00:01:43,567 --> 00:01:46,288
Karta sedm: Jste v bance.

18
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,827
You are at the bank. You want to open a bank account.

19
00:01:51,033 --> 00:01:53,528
Hello. What can I do for you?

20
00:01:59,733 --> 00:02:04,067
Hello, I want to open an account. How much does the account cost per month?

21
00:02:04,267 --> 00:02:05,767
The account is free of charge.

22
00:02:11,967 --> 00:02:13,467
Will I get a bank card?

23
00:02:13,667 --> 00:02:15,833
Yes, you'll get the card by post within a week.

24
00:02:22,033 --> 00:02:24,033
Can I have online banking?

25
00:02:24,233 --> 00:02:26,967
Yes, online banking is free.

26
00:02:33,167 --> 00:02:34,389
Do I need a passport?

27
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:37,133
Yes, you need a passport and a residence permit.

28
00:02:37,333 --> 00:02:40,333
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

29
00:02:40,533 --> 00:02:41,926
Thank you, goodbye.

30
00:02:42,133 --> 00:02:44,978
Karta osm: Jste v půjčovně kol.

31
00:02:45,267 --> 00:02:48,814
You are at a bike rental. You want to rent a bike for a trip.

32
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,495
Hello. What can I do for you?

33
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:01,683
Hello, how much is a bike for one day?

34
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:04,550
A bike costs 350 crowns a day.

35
00:03:10,767 --> 00:03:12,167
Will you lend me a helmet too?

36
00:03:12,367 --> 00:03:13,819
We'll lend you a helmet for free.

37
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:22,255
By what time do I have to return the bike?

38
00:03:22,467 --> 00:03:24,967
You have to return the bike by 7 p.m.

39
00:03:31,167 --> 00:03:32,662
Do you have a children's bike too?

40
00:03:32,867 --> 00:03:35,729
Yes, we have children's bikes for kids from 6 years.

41
00:03:35,933 --> 00:03:38,933
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

42
00:03:39,133 --> 00:03:40,267
Have a nice trip!

43
00:03:40,467 --> 00:03:42,935
Karta devět: Jste v kadeřnictví.

44
00:03:43,233 --> 00:03:46,803
You are at a hairdresser's. You want to book a haircut.

45
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,495
Hello. What can I do for you?

46
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:59,200
Good afternoon, do you have a free slot for a haircut?

47
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,167
I'm free tomorrow at three.

48
00:04:07,367 --> 00:04:08,551
How much does it cost?

49
00:04:08,767 --> 00:04:10,758
A haircut costs 400 crowns.

50
00:04:16,967 --> 00:04:18,317
How long does it take?

51
00:04:18,533 --> 00:04:20,300
It takes about 45 minutes.

52
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,120
Can I pay by card?

53
00:04:28,333 --> 00:04:29,863
Yes, you can pay by card.

54
00:04:30,067 --> 00:04:33,067
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

55
00:04:33,267 --> 00:04:34,633
See you tomorrow then, goodbye.

56
00:04:34,833 --> 00:04:37,993
Karta deset: Jste v informačním centru.

57
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:41,724
You are at the information centre. You want to go on a city tour.

58
00:04:42,933 --> 00:04:45,428
Hello. What can I do for you?

59
00:04:51,633 --> 00:04:54,322
Hello, when does the city tour start?

60
00:04:54,533 --> 00:04:56,900
The tour starts at 11 o'clock.

61
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:04,133
How much is it?

62
00:05:04,333 --> 00:05:06,367
A ticket costs 150 crowns.

63
00:05:12,567 --> 00:05:14,259
What language is the tour in?

64
00:05:14,467 --> 00:05:16,700
The tour is in Czech and English.

65
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,200
How long does it take?

66
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,459
The tour takes about two hours.

67
00:05:26,667 --> 00:05:29,667
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

68
00:05:29,867 --> 00:05:31,019
Have a nice day.

69
00:05:31,233 --> 00:05:37,216
Now twelve questions that fit almost every card. Listen and repeat out loud.

70
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:39,085
How much does it cost?

71
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:43,600
When does the course start?

72
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,600
What time are you open?

73
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,150
How long does it take?

74
00:05:56,367 --> 00:05:58,000
Where is the nearest stop?

75
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:03,260
Do you have this jacket in a bigger size?

76
00:06:06,467 --> 00:06:08,087
Can I pay by card?

77
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,800
Do I have to change trains?

78
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,633
What do I have to bring with me?

79
00:06:20,833 --> 00:06:22,300
Is it possible to return it?

80
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:27,167
How do I get to the station?

81
00:06:30,367 --> 00:06:32,933
Could you tell me where the ticket office is?

82
00:06:36,133 --> 00:06:39,192
Five typical mistakes that cost people points.

83
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:48,685
Correct: Kolik to stojí? Don’t just read the word from the card. Ask a full question.

84
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:59,794
Correct: Můžu platit kartou? You must ask, not state. A question ends with a question mark.

85
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:10,324
Correct: Máte volný termín? With the examiner you speak formally: máte, můžete.

86
00:07:14,033 --> 00:07:22,185
Correct: Kdy jede vlak do Brna? Put the question word first: kdy, kde, kolik.

87
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:34,956
Correct: Je tam parkoviště? Prepare the fourth question in advance. Good ones: Je tam parkoviště? Můžu přijít i v sobotu?

88
00:07:36,167 --> 00:07:54,215
Summary. First: turn the hint into a full question. Second: speak formally — máte, můžete. Third: put the question word first. And fourth: have your own question ready.

89
00:07:55,400 --> 00:08:05,557
Which card is the hardest for you? Write it in the comments. And if the video helped, give it a like — it helps others preparing for the exam.

90
00:08:06,767 --> 00:08:23,079
On the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website you can practise all cards for free — it listens and checks your question. Link in the description. Tomorrow: big review of Speaking task 3. Subscribe so you don’t miss anything.
